<section class="mx-auto max-w-md px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16">
  <div class="card p-8 text-center">
    <div class="mx-auto h-14 w-14 rounded-full bg-primary-100 flex items-center justify-center text-primary-700 mb-5">
      <svg class="h-7 w-7" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M2.25 8.25h19.5M2.25 9h19.5m-16.5 5.25h6m-6 2.25h3m-3.75 3h15a2.25 2.25 0 002.25-2.25V6.75A2.25 2.25 0 0019.5 4.5h-15a2.25 2.25 0 00-2.25 2.25v10.5A2.25 2.25 0 004.5 19.5z" /></svg>
    </div>
    <h1 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink">Cổng thanh toán demo</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-muted mt-2">
      Đây là cổng thanh toán giả lập để kiểm thử luồng mua khóa học. Khi triển khai thật, thay bằng VNPay/Momo/Stripe
      trong <code class="text-xs bg-primary-50 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">services/paymentService.js</code>.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-6 text-left text-sm bg-primary-50 rounded-lg p-4 space-y-1">
      <p><span class="text-muted">Khóa học:</span> <span class="font-medium text-ink"><%= order.course.title %></span></p>
      <p><span class="text-muted">Mã đơn hàng:</span> <span class="font-medium text-ink"><%= order.transactionRef %></span></p>
      <p><span class="text-muted">Số tiền:</span> <span class="font-bold text-primary-700"><%= order.amount.toLocaleString('vi-VN') %>đ</span></p>
    </div>

    <form action="/checkout/mock-pay/<%= order._id %>/confirm" method="POST" class="mt-6">
      <button type="submit" class="btn-primary w-full">Xác nhận đã thanh toán</button>
    </form>
  </div>
</section>
